{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[{"docsStarts":1},{"foundation":2,"assurance":3},"/foundation/docs/","/assurance/docs/getting-started/"],"uses":{}},null,{"type":"data","data":[{"docs":1,"source":44},{"nav":2,"slugs":43,"first":6},[3,7,11,15,19,23,27,31,35,39],{"name":4,"href":5,"slug":6},"Getting started","/assurance/docs/getting-started/","getting-started",{"name":8,"href":9,"slug":10},"Scenarios","/assurance/docs/scenarios/","scenarios",{"name":12,"href":13,"slug":14},"Business context","/assurance/docs/business-context/","business-context",{"name":16,"href":17,"slug":18},"Evidence","/assurance/docs/evidence/","evidence",{"name":20,"href":21,"slug":22},"The CLI","/assurance/docs/cli/","cli",{"name":24,"href":25,"slug":26},"Running in CI","/assurance/docs/ci/","ci",{"name":28,"href":29,"slug":30},"Adapters","/assurance/docs/adapters/","adapters",{"name":32,"href":33,"slug":34},"Analyzers","/assurance/docs/analyzers/","analyzers",{"name":36,"href":37,"slug":38},"Privacy","/assurance/docs/privacy/","privacy",{"name":40,"href":41,"slug":42},"Performance","/assurance/docs/performance/","performance",[6,10,14,18,22,26,30,34,38,42],{"repo":45,"version":46},"https://github.com/AHRConsulting/Ahr.Assurance","0.1.0"],"uses":{"params":["product"]}},{"type":"data","data":[{"slug":1,"page":2},"evidence",{"slug":1,"title":3,"html":4,"headings":5,"source":16},"Evidence","\u003Cp>Every verification writes JSON evidence for its run, and the report is built from it. Tools that read it can use the \u003Ca href=\"/assurance/schemas/assurance-evidence.v1.json\">JSON schema\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"attachments\">Attachments\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>A step attaches screenshots, files and text to itself:\u003C/p>\n\u003C!-- snippet: attach -->\n\u003Cpre class=\"code\" data-lang=\"csharp\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\">return\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\"> Scenario.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Define\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"An order's confirmation is kept as evidence\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Given\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"A paid order\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, () \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\">=>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\"> { })\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">When\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"The confirmation is shown\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, () \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\">=>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\"> Attach.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Bytes\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"Confirmation screen\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, screenshot, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"image/png\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">))\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Then\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"The response names the order\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, () \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-keyword)\">=>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">        Attach.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Text\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"response.json\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, body);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">        Assert.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">Contains\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-string)\">\"42\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">, body);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    })\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">    .\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-function)\">VerifyAsync\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:var(--ahr-code-fg)\">();\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>Attach.Bytes\u003C/code> takes content and its media type. \u003Ccode>Attach.File\u003C/code> copies a file. \u003Ccode>Attach.Text\u003C/code> stores text.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Attachments go to the run's \u003Ccode>attachments\u003C/code> folder, and the report links each one from its step.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>For browser tests, the \u003Ca href=\"/assurance/docs/adapters/#playwright\">Playwright adapter\u003C/a> captures a page after each step.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-evidence-goes\">Where evidence goes\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Each run writes its evidence to its own folder, set by \u003Ccode>ahr-assurance.json\u003C/code>. \u003Ca href=\"/assurance/docs/cli/#set-up-a-project\">Set up a project\u003C/a> shows every setting.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-own-tools\">Your own tools\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>A sink receives each verification's evidence as it is verified. Implement \u003Ca href=\"/assurance/api/Ahr.Assurance.Reporting.IAssuranceEvidenceSink/\">IAssuranceEvidenceSink\u003C/a> and list it in \u003Ccode>ReportOptions.Sinks\u003C/code>. The list replaces the built-in sinks.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"/assurance/api/Ahr.Assurance.Reporting.AssuranceResults/\">AssuranceResults\u003C/a> reads a run folder's evidence and finds each attachment, also after the folder has moved.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>Evidence can contain sensitive data. See \u003Ca href=\"/assurance/docs/privacy/\">privacy\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>\n",[6,10,13],{"id":7,"text":8,"level":9},"attachments","Attachments",2,{"id":11,"text":12,"level":9},"where-evidence-goes","Where evidence goes",{"id":14,"text":15,"level":9},"your-own-tools","Your own tools","docs/evidence.md"],"uses":{"params":["page","product"]}}]}
